msgid "Typical questions this path answers quickly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blog/why_magi_depyf.md:74
msgid "Did fullgraph/subgraph events happen in the expected order?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blog/why_magi_depyf.md:75
msgid "Which pass changed graph structure?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blog/why_magi_depyf.md:76
msgid "Did `RestartAnalysis` happen, and was cache load skipped as expected?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blog/why_magi_depyf.md:77
msgid "Which event folder contains the exact graph/code snapshot for debugging?"
msgstr ""

